<title>USA: Sun Co Inc Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Sun Co Inc Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.10     loss	 $0.22</p>
<p> Net profit		18,000     loss	 5,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,744,000		2,472,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  73,000		   73,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings per share after a provision for preferred dividend payments.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 operating income: $39 million, or $0.38 a share.</p>
<p>1997 Q1 includes a $21 million after tax provision for employee terminations and related costs.</p>
<p>1996 Q1 includes a gain of $19 million from discontinued opeations.</p>
</text>
